# A1.09/A1_09_verbs_review.letz
# Source: Quizlet "A1 Basics Beginner Luxembourgish Verbs"

@lesson A1.09 "Verbs Review"

# --- Action verbs ---
@word schwätzen = to speak
@word ginn = to give
@word hunn = to have
@word sinn = to be
@word wunnen = to live
@word heeschen = to be called
@word bréngen = to bring
@word spillen = to play
@word schaffen = to work
@word kommen = to come
@word maachen = to make
@word goen = to go
@word fueren = to drive
@word huelen = to take

# --- Modal verbs ---
@word mussen = must
@word kënnen = can
@word wëllen = to want
@word sollen = should
@word däerfen = to be allowed to

# --- Sentences (review using verbs from previous lessons) ---

@sentence
@lu Ech schwätzen Lëtzebuergesch.
@en I speak Luxembourgish.
@distractor-en write
@distractor-en understand
@distractor-lu schreiwen
@distractor-lu verstoen

@sentence
@lu Du gëss mir e Bic.
@en You give me a pen.
